<Layouts.flash_group flash={@flash} />

<main class="flex-1 px-8 py-12 max-w-4xl bg-white mx-auto w-full">
  <section class="space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
    <p class="text-blue-700">
      This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when
      you access or use our platform and services.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-black">1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      We may collect information you provide directly, such as your name, email, and account
      details. We also collect data automatically through your use of our platform, including
      activity logs, device information, and cookies.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-black">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>
      The information we collect is used to provide and improve our services, communicate important
      updates, personalize your experience, and ensure the security of our platform. We do not sell
      your personal data to third parties.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-black">3. Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
    <p>
      We may share your information with trusted service providers who help us operate the platform
      or provide services to you. We only share the minimum necessary information, and all partners
      are required to protect your data.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-black">4. Data Security</h2>
    <p>
      We take reasonable measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access,
      disclosure, or destruction. While no system is completely secure, we continuously monitor and
      improve our security practices.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-black">5. Your Choices</h2>
    <p>
      You can access, update, or delete your account information at any time. You can also manage
      communication preferences and opt out of certain data collection where applicable.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-black">6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy occasionally to reflect changes in our practices or legal
      requirements. Continued use of our platform after updates indicates your acceptance of the
      revised policy.
    </p>
  </section>
</main>
<footer class="flex justify-end px-8 py-6 bg-white">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
    <%!-- <span class="h-22 w-px bg-gray-300"></span> --%>
    <span>&copy;2026 Trace</span>
    <span>All rights reserved</span>
  </div>
</footer>
